      "mergedPostDetails": "Description\n\nAvatar menu sorting is missing, we believe this is a bug as the Wing and World menu sorting is present and functioning.\n\n-----\n\nSteps to Reproduce\n\n1. Launch VRChat and open the menu.\n\n2. Open the avatar menu and select MyAvatars.\n\n3. The sorting that existed in the previous version is gone, and the order of avatars is fixed to the order of uploads.\n\n-----\n\nActual Result\n\n*Avatar Sorting :Does not work in menus.(works fine in Wing)\n\n*World Sorting  :No problem.\n\n-----\n\nExpected Result\n\nCan be sorted correctly in the avatar menu.\n\n-----\n\nWorkaround\n\nUse sorting from Wing.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Sort function in avatar menu not working properly, loss of sort button",
