      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Is it true that in the open beta we can’t filter our own avatars by name, upload time, or other criteria? That would be a disaster if it stays the same in the live version. Also, please don’t make the avatar market the default first tab—or at least give us an option to change the tab order. It’s really annoying having to switch back to uploaded avatars every time. I get that the avatar market is there to generate revenue, but I’ve been a VRC Plus subscriber for two years without relying on it. Uploaded avatars are a core feature of the game, so please don’t downgrade the user experience.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
