  "details": "# Issue:\n\nWith the AVM Update to the Avatars Tab in the Main Menu all the previous options were moved to \"My Avatars\".\n\nMy Avatars is missing quite a lot of features compared to live:\n\n- No more \"compact view\"\n\n- You can no longer sort the different categories (e.g. Date Added, Last Updated, Name, Recently Used, Performance)\n\n- Minimizing the navigation panel removes the categories all together instead of making them icons\n\nIn general the new Avatars UI feels very weird and not coherent with the rest of the Menu.\n\n# Expected Behaviour / Suggestion:\n\nThese missing features should be reimplemented to prevent this being a regression compared to live.\n\n\"My Avatars\" should have imo just looked like it currently does on live with a \"Purchased\" category edited to it. Currently it just looks really out of place.\n\n# Attachments:\n\nHere are screenshots comparing the two:",
